MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a parent folder of this stage. But, for PyInstaller's multi-package use,
#  PyInstaller decides to write PyInstaller-generated files in a root directory of the source code directory.
#  See https://github.com/pyinstaller/pyinstaller/issues/2227
#
# The default exception is your *own* .spec file if you choose to commit it.
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

